<section class="page-section">
  <h2 class="page-section--title">The second book (2017)</h2>
  <img class="page-banner" src="{% static_image '/files/book/libro-banner-2.jpg' %}" alt="Cover of the second Lugares Míticos de Jaén book" loading="lazy">

  <p>We went back to Verkami in mid-September 2017. We asked for a minimum of €4,500 and raised around €5,500. As with the first book, the rest was the work contributed by the authors and the team.</p>
  <p>Its sixteen chapters open with "Jaén, cerca y lejos", a piece by <strong>Antonio Muñoz Molina</strong>. The cover is the work of Juan Montoro Peralta, el Creata.</p>
  <p>It was presented on 5 December 2017, again at the Old Chapel of the Hospital San Juan de Dios in Jaén.</p>

